   "id": 532584,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A round tray sits on top of the dining room table. The radius of the tray is 15 in. What is the area taken up by the tray?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The area of a circle with radius <i>r</i> is <span data-math=\"A = \\pi {r^2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A = \\pi {r^2} = \\pi {\\left( {{\\text{15 in}}} \\right)^2} = 225\\pi {\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2} \\approx 706.89{\\text{ i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>The area of a circle is 706.86 square inches.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"706.86\\,{\\text{i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}\">706.86\\,{\\text{i}}{{\\text{n}}^2}</span>"
    }
   ],
